WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
All armies and horses returned in triumph

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,000
Why hasn't Mr. Li returned yet?

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,480
Could it be that he was ambushed by an expert?

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,400
Your Majesty, please forgive me for speaking out.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,600
It's okay for you to worry about anyone

6
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:12,380
But I'm just worried that Mr. Li doesn't need to say this. What does Wei Chen think?

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,940
Your Majesty should be worried about the remnant soldiers of Qi State

8
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,180
Don't bump into Li Da

9
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,820
Just General Lee’s bulldozer tactics

10
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,340
Qi Jun could urinate on the spot if he bumped into him

11
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,060
Weiou, the fierce general of only three clouds

12
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,300
They could all be smashed into pieces by General Li.

13
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:25,020
It’s Qi Jun who should be worried, right?

14
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,500
Lonely Enemy really doesn’t care too much

15
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,200
Xiaobai please

16
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:37,360
Your Majesty, a certain family’s plan has come true.

17
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,100
Brother Li, your plan didn’t work.

18
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,700
The majesty you strive to protect should be used as an army to bypass the rear.

19
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,300
As a result, I haven’t even seen a single person yet.

20
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,620
Your plan to attack from both sides

21
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,620
It's completely useless. It's nonsense.

22
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:49,520
It doesn't matter whether Ma Wei comes back or not, so what's important?

23
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,040
Ma Wei is just an attention-seeking toddler, you say

24
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,720
Is a certain family fighting back from the rear to cooperate with the frontal army?

25
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:57,160
Qi Gou formed a two-sided attack force

26
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,440
Just say there was no flanking attack.

27
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,440
Yes, we were flanked, but Brother Li

28
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,120
You were killing me from the front.

29
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:04,080
Passed through a hundred thousand troops

30
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,160
He ran to someone else's house and killed him.

31
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:07,280
How does this count?

32
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:10,080
Don't worry about how a certain family got behind, just say

33
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:14,600
Didn't the Warring States Period lead to a catastrophic attack from both front and back, Brother Han?

34
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:16,280
You are just jealous of a certain family

35
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,600
The plan is more advanced than yours

36
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,360
The first in civil and military affairs since ancient times, the second in martial arts

37
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,440
But in a certain company, this is greater than the title of number one job seeker

38
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,340
That's the king of ten against ten weapons.

39
00:01:26,540 --> 00:01:27,740
Just say that a certain company is attacking from both sides.

40
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:29,660
Will his plan come true or not?

41
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:30,940
Mr. Li has no other options

42
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:32,620
The plan is naturally complete. Did you hear that?

43
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:34,580
The overview of the king's capital concludes that a certain family is generous

44
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:36,980
I won’t argue with you cowards like you, Han Aiqing.

45
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:38,500
You'd better not argue with Mr. Li.

46
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:40,700
I remembered that there was still a step to be taken in the palace.
